Z||000002||Taijiguy||07-06-2000||08:12 AM||||I'm not too sure about the hoses next to the map sensor, if you can describe them more specifically, I might be able to help. The one next to the distributer may go to the EGR valve, or, there's a connection on the bottom of the upper plenum that's hard to see. The large port on the manifold I believe is just blocked off.(it was on mine to no adverse effect)<BR>I think I can send you a bolt, I may have an extra couple laying around, no charge, maybe postage due, but I doubt it's even enough to worry about. Email me if you want me to check on that for you.<P>Taiji||||reg||1
